{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the forgotten halls of a deserted schoolhouse, nothing could possibly go wrong, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/extras/a285569470e1a6979b1c8dd0dcc95561.avif?t=1749796170\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find yourself trapped in a webby hallucination, you must explore and try to escape an abandoned education facility whilst avoiding unwanted and aggressive hosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need a strong mind and quick wits, as this school has more problems than simple mathematics...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story driven game but with fun minigames and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles that make you think.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interesting and unsettling environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide or fight away the mannequins and other things that may be after you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the minigame-locked hard drives to find out on whats happening! </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2433010?t=1749796170","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/158a6d694a41388339f1963f27457f78bcf97bcb/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749796170","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/40ac2d887f43a99b5358e0d501eaa11b0d065d25/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1749796170","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/40ac2d887f43a99b5358e0d501eaa11b0d065d25/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1749796170","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wander the forgotten halls of a deserted schoolhouse, nothing could possibly go wrong, right?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/extras/a285569470e1a6979b1c8dd0dcc95561.avif?t=1749796170\" data-has-big width=800 height=240 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you find yourself trapped in a webby hallucination, you must explore and try to escape an abandoned education facility whilst avoiding unwanted and aggressive hosts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll need a strong mind and quick wits, as this school has more problems than simple mathematics...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A story driven game but with fun minigames and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging puzzles that make you think.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore interesting and unsettling environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide or fight away the mannequins and other things that may be after you!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock the minigame-locked hard drives to find out on whats happening! </p></li></ul>","developers":["Xio-Fret Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2433010/96d972e36f323db47c6b2e4b86ed570c20bfe6d6/header.jpg?t=1749796170","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul clas